---
// System.astro - Redesigned based on fuckfuck.html with Orange theme
---

<section class="section price-section" id="system">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head motion-up">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">04 / Price</p>
        <h2>料金システム</h2>
        <p class="section-copy">柔術を始めたい方へ通いやすいプランをご用意しています。</p>
      </div>
      <span class="section-index" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
    </div>

    <div class="price-grid">
      <article class="price-card motion-up" data-motion-delay="0.0">
        <span class="plan-en">MEN</span>
        <h3>男性会員</h3>
        <p class="price-value">¥9,800</p>
        <span class="price-unit">/月 (税込)</span>
        <ul>
          <li>通い放題（全クラス参加可能）</li>
          <li>スパーリング・フリースパー参加可</li>
          <li>すべての設備が使い放題</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="price-card motion-up" data-motion-delay="0.1">
        <span class="plan-en">WOMEN / STUDENTS</span>
        <h3>女性・中高生会員</h3>
        <p class="price-value">¥7,800</p>
        <span class="price-unit">/月 (税込)</span>
        <ul>
          <li>通い放題（全クラス参加可能）</li>
          <li>女性や学生も安心して通える環境</li>
          <li>すべての設備が使い放題</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="price-card motion-up" data-motion-delay="0.2">
        <span class="plan-en">KIDS</span>
        <h3>キッズ会員<small>(小学1〜6年生)</small></h3>
        <p class="price-value">¥5,000</p>
        <span class="price-unit">/月 (税込)</span>
        <ul>
          <li>キッズクラス参加可能</li>
          <li>礼儀作法や基礎体力の向上</li>
          <li>楽しく安全に柔術を学べます</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="price-card motion-up" data-motion-delay="0.3">
        <span class="plan-en">VISITOR</span>
        <h3>ビジター<small>(1回利用)</small></h3>
        <p class="price-value">¥2,200</p>
        <span class="price-unit">/回 (税込)</span>
        <ul>
          <li>1回のみのスポット利用</li>
          <li>出張や旅行中の練習に</li>
          <li>当日お支払い</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="price-footer motion-fade" data-motion-delay="0.2">
      <p class="price-admission">入会金無料</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/contact">
        無料体験を予約する <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .price-section {
    background: #f4f4ee;
    padding-block: 108px;
    color: #141613;
    font-family: 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;
  }

  .wrap {
    width: min(1220px, calc(100% - 48px));
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', Impact, sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #ff6b00;
  }

  .eyebrow::before {
    content: "";
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    background: currentColor;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .section-head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 44px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #141613;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .section-head h2 {
    margin: 8px 0 0;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.8vw, 44px);
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .section-copy {
    max-width: 710px;
    margin-top: 14px;
    color: #666a61;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .section-index {
    color: #a2a799;
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', Impact, sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(48px, 6vw, 76px);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 0.85;
  }

  .price-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .price-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    padding: 28px 24px;
    border: 1px solid #dbded3;
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
  }

  .price-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(20, 22, 19, 0.08);
  }

  .plan-en {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', Impact, sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: #666a61;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .price-card h3 {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 18px 0 26px;
    min-height: 54px;
  }

  .price-card h3 small {
    display: block;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-top: 3px;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .price-value {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', Impact, sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(40px, 4vw, 56px);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    white-space: nowrap;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .price-unit {
    display: block;
    font-size: 11px;
    margin-top: 10px;
    color: #666a61;
  }


  .price-card ul {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(133, 138, 121, 0.3);
    padding-top: 23px;
    margin-top: 27px;
    list-style: none;
    padding-left: 0;
  }

  .price-card li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 18px;
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .price-card li::before {
    content: "✓";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: #ff6b00;
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .price-footer {
    margin-top: 28px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 20px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .price-admission {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #141613;
  }

  .text-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding-bottom: 4px;
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid currentColor;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    transition: color 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .text-link:hover {
    color: #ff6b00;
    border-color: #ff6b00;
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .price-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
    .price-card h3 {
      min-height: auto;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .price-section {
      padding-block: 72px;
    }
    .wrap {
      width: calc(100% - 32px);
    }
    .price-card {
      padding: 23px 16px;
    }
    .price-grid {
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .price-card h3 {
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    .price-value {
      font-size: clamp(33px, 9vw, 48px);
    }
    .price-card li {
      font-size: 10px;
    }
    .price-footer {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 12px;
    }
  }
</style>
